          We ran 14 paint sprayers through real walls, kitchen cabinets, fences, and exterior siding for six months. Airless, HVLP, handheld, and cordless — here's what actually produces a clean finish and what's a waste of a weekend.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
          <a href="#graco-magnum-x7" class="px-8 py-4 bg-[#FF4500] hover:bg-[#E63E00] text-white font-black rounded-xl shadow-lg transition-all no-underline">
            See Our #1 Pick
          </a>
          <a href="#how-to-spray" class="px-8 py-4 bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white font-bold rounded-xl border border-white/10 no-underline">
            How to Spray Like a Pro
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 pt-12">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-6 border-b border-gray-100 pb-8">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <AuthorAvatar size={48} />
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-900">Alex Rivers</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest">Home Improvement Editor</p>
