          <a href="#prep" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">4. Prep & Masking: The Step Everyone Underestimates</a>
          <a href="#faq" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">5. FAQ</a>
